sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Owner as Trusted Owner
    participant Session as CPU HESession
    participant Artifacts as Artifact Workspace Manager
    participant Backend as OpenFHE Backend
    participant Files as Filesystem / PVC Workspace
    participant Compute as Compute-only HESession

    Owner->>Session: save(input_ct, workspace, name="input")
    Session->>Artifacts: save_ciphertext(session, value, workspace, name)

    alt Workspace does not exist yet
        Artifacts->>Files: create material/ and ciphertexts/
        Artifacts->>Backend: export_public_material(material/)
        Backend->>Files: context.bin
        Backend->>Files: public-key.bin
        Backend->>Files: multiplication-keys.bin
        Backend->>Files: rotation-keys.bin
        Artifacts->>Files: create manifest.json with checksums
    else Workspace already exists
        Artifacts->>Files: read manifest.json
        Artifacts->>Artifacts: validate backend, context, key bundle and config
    end

    Artifacts->>Backend: serialize_ciphertext(input_ct)
    Backend->>Files: ciphertexts/input.bin
    Artifacts->>Files: update ciphertext record and checksum
    Artifacts-->>Owner: artifact path

    Owner->>Compute: open_workspace(workspace, execution_backend="openfhe")
    Compute->>Artifacts: workspace_open_parameters(workspace)
    Artifacts->>Files: read manifest and verify all material checksums
    Artifacts-->>Compute: CKKSConfig + IDs + material path
    Compute->>Backend: from_public_material(config, material/)
    Backend->>Files: load context.bin and public-key.bin
    Backend->>Files: load multiplication-keys.bin and rotation-keys.bin
    Backend-->>Compute: compute-only backend without secret key
    Compute-->>Owner: compute-only HESession

    Owner->>Compute: load(workspace, name="input")
    Compute->>Artifacts: load_ciphertext(..., "input")
    Artifacts->>Files: verify artifact metadata and checksum
    Artifacts->>Backend: deserialize ciphertexts/input.bin
    Backend-->>Compute: ciphertext handle
    Compute-->>Owner: EncryptedVector

    Owner->>Compute: sum(input_ct)
    Compute->>Backend: calculate with loaded evaluation keys
    Backend-->>Owner: EncryptedScalar

    Owner->>Compute: save(sum_ct, workspace, name="sum")
    Compute->>Artifacts: serialize ciphertext and update manifest
    Artifacts->>Files: ciphertexts/sum.bin + checksum
    Artifacts-->>Owner: artifact path

    opt Attempt to decrypt in compute-only session
        Owner->>Compute: decrypt(sum_ct)
        Compute-->>Owner: SecretKeyUnavailableError
    end

    Note over Artifacts,Files: The workspace contains no plaintext or secret key.
    Note over Compute,Files: Opening a workspace loads public material once.<br/>Each ciphertext is loaded only when session.load(name=...) is called.
